        {
          "id": 2277039456,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "As far as I can see to default register the company ID it would make sense to have a more generic `dissect_btad_apple()` function with a switch statement for the type.\n\nCurrent \"Find my\" devices use type 0x12 for their advertisments. As we currently only implement iBeacons I would leave it to \"Decode as\" at the moment.",
